SystemRequirements: CmdStan (>= 2.26.0) -- see the 'instantiate' and
    'cmdstanr' packages for installation instructions
    (https://mc-stan.org/cmdstanr/articles/cmdstanr.html). BayGMST cannot fit
    models without a working CmdStan installation; proxy-reduction and
    forcing-transform utilities do not require it.
